# Unity project. All patterns are relative to this folder.
#
# Tracked:  Assets/, Packages/, ProjectSettings/  — the project's actual source.
# Ignored:  everything Unity regenerates from those three on the next open.
#
# Leading slashes are deliberate: they anchor to this folder, so a legitimate
# asset folder named Build/ or Temp/ under Assets/ is not swallowed.

# ---- Unity generated / derived ----
/[Ll]ibrary/
/[Tt]emp/
/[Oo]bj/
/[Bb]uild/
/[Bb]uilds/
/[Ll]ogs/
/[Uu]ser[Ss]ettings/
/[Mm]emoryCaptures/
/[Rr]ecordings/
/[Ee]xported[Oo]bj/

# ---- Never ignore asset .meta files ----
# They carry the import settings we tuned (normal-map type, sRGB flags,
# rig/avatar config, animation events) and the GUIDs that every scene,
# prefab and material reference resolves through. Losing one detaches
# the asset from everything that points at it. For a MODULAR pack this is
# load-bearing twice over: every armour prefab variant resolves its mesh
# and its shared avatar through these GUIDs.
!/[Aa]ssets/**/*.meta

# ---- Autogenerated inside Assets/ ----
/[Aa]ssets/AssetStoreTools*
/[Aa]ssets/Plugins/Editor/JetBrains*
/[Aa]ssets/[Aa]ddressable[Aa]ssets[Dd]ata/*/*.bin*
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa.meta
/[Aa]ssets/[Ss]treamingAssets/aa/*

# ---- Solution / IDE files (Unity regenerates them) ----
*.csproj
*.unityproj
*.sln
*.slnx
*.suo
*.tmp
*.user
*.userprefs
*.pidb
*.booproj
*.svd
*.pdb
*.mdb
*.opendb
*.VC.db
.vs/
.idea/
.vscode/
.gradle/
.consulo/

# The .meta of the ignored binaries above. Must stay AFTER the !*.meta rule —
# in gitignore the last matching pattern wins.
*.pidb.meta
*.pdb.meta
*.mdb.meta

# ---- Build output ----
*.apk
*.aab
*.app
*.unitypackage

# ---- Crash / build reports ----
sysinfo.txt
crashlytics-build.properties

# Unity crash-recovery scenes — editor junk, not source
/Assets/_Recovery/
/Assets/_Recovery.meta
